<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Greenpoint Financial Corp.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Greenpoint Financial Corp.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Montgomery Securities analyst Joseph Jolson said he lowered his rating on Greenpoint Financial Corporation to a hold from a buy.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>--Shares closed off 1/4 at 38.</p>
</text>
